add(법인="Robinhood Markets, Inc.",시작="",무엇을="회사 지표 Funded Customers 정의: Robinhood 법인에 계좌가 하나 이상 있고 최근 45일 안에 잔액이 0보다 컸거나(회사가 넣은 돈만 있는 경우 제외) 그 계좌로 거래를 한 고유한 사람 수. 공동 계좌는 각자 1명. 2026-06부터 WonderFi 고객 포함",값="",단위="",잰것="",기준일="2026-09-30",이유="",틀="개요 > 고객 수 지표 정의",S="S2RH-S01",문장="We define a Funded Customer as a unique person who has at least one account with a Robinhood entity and, within the past 45 calendar days (a) had an account balance that was greater than zero (excluding amounts that are deposited into a Funded Customer account by the Company with no action taken by the unique person) or (b) completed a transaction using any such account.",위치="Key Performance Metrics, Funded Customers",검증=P)
add(법인="Robinhood Markets, Inc.",시작="2024-02",무엇을="2023 Q4 전에는 같은 지표를 Net Cumulative Funded Accounts(계좌 기준 이름)로 불렀고, 사람 수를 잰다는 것을 분명히 하려고 이름만 바꿈. 계산 방식은 같고 과거 수치에 영향 없음. 2023-12 Funded Customers 2,340만(1년 사이 42만 증가)",값="23.4",단위="백만 명",잰것="Funded Customers(2023-12-31)",기준일="2023-12-31",이유="계좌 종류(퇴직 계좌 등)가 늘어 사람 수임을 분명히 하려고",틀="개요 > 고객 수 지표 정의",S="S2RH-S02",문장="Before Q4 2023, we referred to Funded Customers as Net Cumulative Funded Accounts. As our business has grown and we have added additional account types (such as retirement accounts), we have relabeled this metric (and made conforming changes throughout other definitions) to clarify that it measures unique individuals (rather than accounts), although the calculation remains the same and does not affect amounts reported in prior periods.",위치="Key Performance Metrics 머리 문단, Highlights Funded Customers 줄",검증=P)
